Third-Party Protected Files

The following protected MATLAB executable files are not original source code
developed by the copyright holder of this repository:

- CorrMat.p
- N2LogL.p
- FitGPModel.p
- PredictGPModel.p

These files were developed by Bostanabad and co-authors for Gaussian
Process modeling and are included only as executable protected files to enable
reproducibility of the examples in this repository. These files remain the
intellectual property of their original authors and are not covered by the MIT
license granted above.

Users of these protected files should cite the following work:

Bostanabad, R., Kearney, T., Tao, S., Apley, D. W., and Chen, W. (2018).
Leveraging the nugget parameter for efficient Gaussian process modeling.
International Journal for Numerical Methods in Engineering, 114(5), 501-516.
https://doi.org/10.1002/nme.5751

